OL,3,GNEWSANational recognition for project
OL,4,Atackling poverty
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "pioneering" initiative tackling the
OL,7,Froot causes of poverty and health
OL,8,Finequality has been recognised by
OL,9,FEngland's chief medical officer.
OL,11,FThose behind the Ilfracombe Poverty
OL,12,FTruth Commission said the project put
OL,13,Flocal people "at the heart" of
OL,14,Fdecisions about the services and
OL,15,Fsystems that affect their lives, health
OL,16,Fand wellbeing.
OL,18,FLed by Royal Devon University NHS
OL,19,FTrust, the commission sees those with
OL,20,Flived experience of poverty and
OL,21,Forganisations come together to identify
OL,22,Fproblems and address them.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
