OL,3,GNEWSANational recognition for project
OL,4,Atackling poverty
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndrea Beacham, head of neighbourhood
OL,7,Fhealth at the trust, said it worked
OL,8,Falongside residents "to understand the
OL,9,Fchallenges they face" rather than
OL,10,Fassuming what they needed.
